      <h1 id="creating-windows-machineset-nutanix" class="group scroll-mt-20">Creating a Windows MachineSet object on Nutanix<a href="#creating-windows-machineset-nutanix" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
